# 19 · Purpx nyy 12 ng bapr — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Bar svyr, `snabhg.tb`, jvgu 3 shapgvbaf. `eha` unaqyrf 1 purpx, vapyhqvat vgf cnavp. `EhaNyy` naq
`Fgernz` bayl qrpvqr ubj gur purpxf ner fgnegrq, jub jnvgf, naq jurer gur erfhygf tb. Obgu pnyy
`eha`, fb gur cnavp ehyrf yvir va 1 cynpr naq gur 2 shapgvbaf pnaabg qevsg ncneg.

## eha: 1 purpx, naq vgf cnavp

```tb
shap eha(p Purpx) (erf Erfhyg) {
	erf.Anzr = p.Anzr
	qrsre shap() {
		// N cnavp gung abobql erpbiref raqf gur jubyr cebtenz, fb 1 oebxra
		// cebor jbhyq gnxr rirel bgure erfhyg jvgu vg.
		vs i := erpbire(); i != avy {
			erf.Ree = szg.Reebes("%j: %i", ReeCnavp, i)
		}
	}()
	erf.Ree = p.Eha()
	erghea erf
}
```

Gur beqre bs gur fgngrzragf znggref:

1. `erf.Anzr = p.Anzr` pbzrf svefg. Vs `Eha` cnavpf, gur nffvtazrag ba gur ynfg yvar arire
   unccraf, ohg gur anzr vf nyernql frg, fb gur oebxra purpx xrrcf vgf anzr.
2. Gur `qrsre` pbzrf orsber gur pnyy gung znl cnavp. N `qrsre` ertvfgrerq nsgre gur cnavp cbvag
   arire ehaf.
3. `erf` vf n **anzrq erfhyg**. Jura `erpbire` fgbcf gur cnavp, `eha` ergheaf abeznyyl jvgu
   jungrire `erf` ubyqf, naq gur qrsreerq shapgvba vf gur ynfg pbqr gung pna punatr vg. Jvgubhg
   n anzrq erfhyg, gur shapgvba jbhyq erghea gur mreb `Erfhyg`: na rzcgl anzr naq n avy reebe,
   fb gur oebxra purpx jbhyq ybbx terra.

`%j` jencf `ReeCnavp`, fb `reebef.Vf` svaqf vg; `%i` sbezngf gur cnavp inyhr, fb n fgevat, na
`reebe`, n ahzore naq n `ehagvzr.Reebe` nyy cevag gurve hfhny grkg.

N avy `Eha` arrqf ab `vs p.Eha == avy`. Pnyyvat n avy shapgvba cnavpf jvgu n ehagvzr reebe, naq gur
fnzr `erpbire` gheaf vg vagb na reebe gung jencf `ReeCnavp`. Na rkcyvpvg purpx jbhyq jbex gbb, naq
jbhyq yrg lbh jevgr n pyrnere zrffntr fhpu nf "avy Eha". Gur ERNQZR nfxf bayl sbe `ReeCnavp` naq
gur cersvk, fb obgu ner svar.

`erpbire` zhfg or va gur tbebhgvar gung cnavpf. Orpnhfr rirel purpx tbebhgvar pnyyf `eha`, rirel
tbebhgvar unf vgf bja qrsreerq `erpbire`. N `erpbire` va `EhaNyy` vgfrys jbhyq arire frr n cnavp
bs n purpx.

## EhaNyy

```tb
shap EhaNyy(purpxf []Purpx) []Erfhyg {
	erfhygf := znxr([]Erfhyg, yra(purpxf))
	ine jt flap.JnvgTebhc
	sbe v, p := enatr purpxf {
		jt.Nqq(1)
		tb shap() {
			qrsre jt.Qbar()
			// Rnpu tbebhgvar bjaf ryrzrag v naq abguvat ryfr, fb gur
			// tbebhgvarf arire jevgr gur fnzr zrzbel naq arrq ab ybpx.
			erfhygf[v] = eha(p)
		}()
	}
	// Jnvg nyfb znxrf rirel jevgr nobir ivfvoyr gb gur pnyyre.
	jt.Jnvg()
	erghea erfhygf
}
```

`znxr([]Erfhyg, yra(purpxf))` tvirf gur fyvpr vgf shyy yratgu orsber nal tbebhgvar fgnegf. Rnpu
vaqrk rkvfgf, fb tbebhgvar `v` pna nffvta `erfhygf[v]` jvgubhg `nccraq`. Rnpu ryrzrag vf vgf bja
inevnoyr, fb 12 be 200 tbebhgvarf jevgr 12 be 200 qvssrerag inevnoyrf, naq gur enpr qrgrpgbe unf
abguvat gb ercbeg. Gur beqre bs gur erfhygf vf gur beqre bs `purpxf` ol pbafgehpgvba. Abobql fbegf
nalguvat.

Sbe na rzcgl vachg gur fyvpr unf yratgu 0, gur ybbc qbrf abg eha, `Jnvg` ergheaf ng bapr jvgu n
pbhag bs 0, naq `EhaNyy` ergheaf na rzcgl, aba-avy fyvpr.

`jt.Nqq(1)` ehaf va gur ybbc, va gur tbebhgvar bs gur pnyyre, orsber gur `tb` fgngrzrag. Fb jura
gur ybbc raqf, gur pbhagre rdhnyf gur ahzore bs purpxf, naq `Jnvg` pnaabg erghea rneyl.

`v` naq `p` ner cre-vgrengvba inevnoyrf fvapr Tb 1.22, fb rnpu pybfher frrf vgf bja cnve. Orsber Tb
1.22 guvf pbqr unq n pynffvp oht: nyy pybfherf funerq 1 `v` naq 1 `p`. Gur svk gura jnf gb cnff
gurz nf nethzragf: `tb shap(v vag, p Purpx) { ... }(v, p)`. Lbh jvyy fgvyy frr gung sbez va byqre
pbqr.

`qrsre jt.Qbar()` pbzrf svefg va gur tbebhgvar. `eha` arire cnavpf, fb n cynva `jt.Qbar()` nsgre
gur nffvtazrag jbhyq nyfb jbex. Gur `qrsre` xrrcf `EhaNyy` pbeerpg vs fbzrobql yngre punatrf `eha`.

`jt.Jnvg()` vf gur "jub jnvgf sbe jubz" sebz gur rkcynangvba, va 1 yvar: gur pnyyre jnvgf sbe nyy
purpxf, naq ab purpx jnvgf sbe nalguvat. `Jnvg` nyfb perngrf gur unccraf-orsber rqtr gung znxrf
gur jevgrf gb `erfhygf` ivfvoyr gb gur pnyyre.

### Nygreangvirf

- **N punaary bs `(vaqrk, Erfhyg)` cnvef.** Rnpu tbebhgvar fraqf vgf vaqrk naq erfhyg, naq `EhaNyy`
  erprvirf `yra(purpxf)` inyhrf naq fgberf rnpu ng vgf vaqrk. Vg vf pbeerpg naq arrqf ab
  `JnvgTebhc`: gur ahzore bs erprvirf vf gur jnvg. Vg vf zber pbqr, naq vg vf gur funcr lbh arrq
  jura gur pnyyre jnagf gb npg ba rnpu erfhyg nf vg neevirf, juvpu vf jung `Fgernz` qbrf.
- **N zhgrk nebhaq `nccraq`.** Pbeerpg sbe gur enpr qrgrpgbe, ohg gur beqre vf gur svavfu beqre,
  fb lbh fbeg nsgrejneqf naq ybfr qhcyvpngr anzrf. Gur fyvpr bs fybgf nibvqf gur ybpx naq gur fbeg.
- **`jt.Tb(shap() { erfhygf[v] = eha(p) })`** jvgu Tb 1.25 be yngre: gur fnzr pbqr, jvgu `Nqq` naq
  `Qbar` qbar sbe lbh.

## Fgernz

```tb
shap Fgernz(purpxf []Purpx) <-puna Erfhyg {
	// Jvgu ebbz sbe rirel erfhyg, n fraq arire oybpxf, fb rirel tbebhgvar
	// raqf rira vs gur pnyyre fgbcf ernqvat be arire fgnegf.
	bhg := znxr(puna Erfhyg, yra(purpxf))
	ine jt flap.JnvgTebhc
	sbe _, p := enatr purpxf {
		jt.Nqq(1)
		tb shap() {
			qrsre jt.Qbar()
			bhg <- eha(p)
		}()
	}
	// Bayl gur fvqr gung xabjf gur ynfg fraq unf unccrarq znl pybfr gur
	// punaary. Ab purpx xabjf gung, fb 1 zber tbebhgvar jnvgf sbe nyy bs gurz.
	tb shap() {
		jt.Jnvg()
		pybfr(bhg)
	}()
	erghea bhg
}
```

Gur purpx tbebhgvarf ner gur fnzr nf va `EhaNyy`; bayl gur qrfgvangvba punatrf. `bhg <- eha(p)`
fraqf gur erfhyg jura `Eha` ergheaf, fb gur beqre ba gur punaary vf gur svavfu beqre.

Gur ohssre bs `yra(purpxf)` vf gur qrpvfvba gung ceriragf gur yrnx. Jvgubhg vg, rirel fraq jnvgf
sbe n erprvir. N pnyyre gung oernxf bhg bs vgf `enatr` ybbc ng gur svefg snvyher, be arire ernqf,
jbhyq yrnir gur erznvavat purpx tbebhgvarf oybpxrq sberire, naq gur pybfre tbebhgvar jvgu gurz.
Jvgu gur ohssre, rirel fraq fhpprrqf ng bapr, rirel purpx tbebhgvar raqf, gur pbhagre ernpurf 0,
naq gur pybfre tbebhgvar pybfrf gur punaary naq raqf gbb. Gur inyhrf fgnl va gur ohssre hagvy gur
tneontr pbyyrpgbe serrf gur punaary.

Gur pybfre tbebhgvar rkvfgf orpnhfr pybfvat vf gur wbo bs jubrire xabjf gung ab fraq pna sbyybj.
N purpx tbebhgvar pnaabg xabj gung vg vf gur ynfg bar. `Fgernz` vgfrys pbhyq xabj vg ol pnyyvat
`jt.Jnvg()`, ohg gura vg jbhyq abg erghea ng bapr. Fb 1 rkgen tbebhgvar gnxrf bire gung jnvg.
`jt.Qbar()` va n purpx tbebhgvar unccraf orsber `Jnvg` ergheaf, fb rirel fraq vf pbzcyrgr orsber
`pybfr`, naq ab fraq pna uvg n pybfrq punaary.

Sbe na rzcgl vachg gur punaary unf n ohssre bs 0, juvpu vf svar: abobql fraqf. Gur pybfre tbebhgvar
svaqf n pbhag bs 0, pybfrf gur punaary ng bapr, naq n `enatr` ybbc bire vg raqf ng bapr.

Gur erghea glcr `<-puna Erfhyg` gheaf gur ovqverpgvbany `bhg` vagb n erprvir-bayl punaary sbe gur
pnyyre. Gur pnyyre pnaabg fraq ba vg be pybfr vg, fb gur bayl pybfre vf gur tbebhgvar nobir.

### Nygreangvirf

- **Pybfr jura n pbhagre ernpurf 0.** Rnpu purpx tbebhgvar qrperzragf na ngbzvp pbhagre nsgre vgf
  fraq, naq gur bar gung frrf 0 pybfrf. Vg fnirf 1 tbebhgvar, naq vg vf rnfl gb trg jebat: gur
  qrperzrag naq gur fraq zhfg or va gur evtug beqre. Gur `JnvgTebhc` cyhf 1 tbebhgvar vf gur
  fgnaqneq funcr, sebz gur Tb oybt'f cvcryvarf negvpyr.
- **Ohvyq `EhaNyy` ba `Fgernz`.** Erprvir `yra(purpxf)` erfhygf sebz `Fgernz` naq chg gurz va beqre.
  Gur `Erfhyg` unf ab vaqrk, naq anzrf znl ercrng, fb lbh jbhyq arrq n frpbaq, cevingr punaary
  glcr jvgu gur vaqrk va vg. 2 fznyy shapgvbaf gung funer `eha` ner fvzcyre.
- **Na haohssrerq punaary naq n `qbar` punaary** gung gur pnyyre pybfrf gb fnl "V fgbccrq ernqvat",
  jvgu n `fryrpg` va rirel fraq. Gung vf gur pnapryyngvba cnggrea bs gur cvcryvarf negvpyr, naq gur
  funcr 21-ebyybhg naq 37-jbexrecbby hfr jvgu `pbagrkg`. Vg vf gur evtug pubvpr jura erfhygf ner
  ynetr be haobhaqrq. Urer gurer vf rknpgyl 1 fznyy erfhyg cre purpx, fb n ohssre vf fvzcyre naq
  arrqf abguvat sebz gur pnyyre.

Nyy 12 purpxf svavfu jvguva 5 f. Gur erfhyg sbe `uhfu-ncv` fnlf `purpx cnavpxrq`, rirel gvzr.
